# CODEOWNERS — default reviewers for pull requests.
#
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern for a changed file wins. Owners are
# requested for review automatically when a PR touches files they own.
#
# NOTE for maintainers: `@bettercollected/maintainers` is a placeholder team.
# Create that team under the org (or replace it with individual @handles) for
# these rules to take effect — GitHub ignores rules whose owner it can't resolve.

# Fallback owner for everything not matched below.
*                       @bettercollected/maintainers

# Service-scoped ownership — adjust as the team grows.
/webapp/                @bettercollected/maintainers
/backend/               @bettercollected/maintainers
/auth/                  @bettercollected/maintainers
/integrations/          @bettercollected/maintainers
/temporal/              @bettercollected/maintainers
/common/                @bettercollected/maintainers

# CI, release, and repo-governance files warrant extra scrutiny.
/.github/               @bettercollected/maintainers
/docs/                  @bettercollected/maintainers
